{"id":"gorazdo","lemma":"гораздо","pos":"adv","rank":519,"glosses":["much, far, by far, a lot, considerably, quite"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/24/Ru-%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Теперь гораздо лучше.","en":"It's much better now.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Моя идея была гораздо лучше.","en":"My idea was much better.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"idea, thought, notion"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Он гораздо лучше тебя.","en":"He is much better than you.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Ты выглядишь действительно гораздо лучше.","en":"You're really looking much better.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"},{"g":"really"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Тот дом гораздо лучше, чем этот.","en":"That house is much better than this.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones"},{"g":"house, building"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"than"},{"g":"this/that one"}]}]}